[372.375, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 4/8 · Challenge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Assumptions, riskiest first.** Each one is tested against the page itself, not by reasoning:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  1. **Dark mode works.** I've never looked at it, and the featured card inverts there.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  2. **The three-column layout holds at tablet widths** (about 920 px), where the cards are narrowest and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \"Try Studio free for 14 days\" button is longest.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  3. **The monthly toggle and the slider work in states other than the default.** I only ever saw yearly with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  8 invoices.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  4. **The slider's recommendation is correct.** It reads invoices only, but Starter is also capped at 3\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  clients.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  5. **The numbers hold up.** That means the savings, the \"2 months free\" badge, and agreement between the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  cards and the table.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
